flowchart TD
  Owner[Owner policy bundle and G1 approval]
  G0[G0: PR #80 fresh evidence and independent review]
  C1[2B-1 joint V1 contract checkpoint\nreserve 0190 only]
  C2[2B-2 private authority and receipt schema\nconsume 0190]
  C3[2B-3 provider-free deterministic simulator]
  C4[2B-4 protected candidate custody]
  C5[2B-5 direct-human reviewed CRM effect]
  C6[2B-6 Integration Review UI]
  Pilot[Separate provider pilot gate]

  Owner --> C1
  G0 --> C1
  C1 --> C2 --> C3 --> C4 --> C5 --> C6 --> Pilot

  subgraph Ingress[Boundary A — no provider activation]
    Verify[Fixed endpoint + signing verification\nraw bytes before parse]
    Reserve[Reserve event identity + digest]
    Route[Historical installation → connection → grant → mapping]
    Outcome[Commit one bounded outcome]
    Verify --> Reserve --> Route --> Outcome
  end

  subgraph Review[Boundary B — direct-human only]
    Reauth[Current human/school/capability/entitlement reauthorization]
    Recover[Original K result recovery\nor unchanged-K fresh check]
    Atomic[One atomic decision + case close + unique effect\ncanonical CRM lead + provenance + audit + inert evidence]
    Reauth --> Recover --> Atomic
  end

  C3 -. provider-free evidence only .-> Ingress
  C5 -. approved future backend proof .-> Review
  Outcome -. no candidate/CRM/provider effect .-> Hold[Fail closed until later gate]

